Package raw decrypts Sony's SR2 block as the function sony_decrypt of dcraw
does, reads the levels and the white balance of that block from the tags
dcraw reads them from, and decodes Sony's compressed raw and its curve as
sony_arw2_load_raw and the handling of tag 0x7010 do.

dcraw
https://www.dechifro.org/dcraw/
Copyright 1997-2018 by Dave Coffin, dcoffin a cybercom o net

dcraw.c states: "No license is required to download and use dcraw.c." Its
restrictions apply only to the functions it marks RESTRICTED, those for
Foveon sensors, of which this package uses none.

Its demosaicing is Ratio Corrected Demosaicing (RCD), as Luis Sanz Rodríguez
described it in 2017, written anew for this package. Lossless JPEG is decoded
as ITU-T Recommendation T.81 specifies it.

No code of LibRaw, RawSpeed, RawTherapee, darktable or ART, which are under
the LGPL or the GPL, is in this package.
